\n{{lead}}\n\nAnswers:\n{{answers}}","de_DE":"Neuer Eintrag aus „{{form:title}}“.\n\n{{lead}}\n\nAntworten:\n{{answers}}","de_DE_formal":"Neuer Eintrag aus „{{form:title}}“.\n\n{{lead}}\n\nAntworten:\n{{answers}}","es_ES":"Nueva entrada de «{{form:title}}».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRespuestas:\n{{answers}}","fr_FR":"Nouvelle entrée de « {{form:title}} ».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRéponses :\n{{answers}}","it_IT":"Nuova voce da «{{form:title}}».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRisposte:\n{{answers}}"},"nl2br":true,"transport":{"type":"wp_mail"},"layout":"branded"}},{"id":"a_reply","on":"submit","kind":"autoresponder","config":{"to":{"en_US":"{{field:email}}","de_DE":"{{field:email}}","de_DE_formal":"{{field:email}}","es_ES":"{{field:email}}","fr_FR":"{{field:email}}","it_IT":"{{field:email}}"},"cc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"bcc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"from":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"fromName":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"replyTo":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"subject":{"en_US":"We have received your request","de_DE":"Wir haben deine Anfrage erhalten","de_DE_formal":"Wir haben Ihre Anfrage erhalten","es_ES":"Hemos recibido tu solicitud","fr_FR":"Nous avons bien reçu votre demande","it_IT":"Abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta"},"body":{"en_US":"Hello {{field:name}},\n\nthank you for your request. We have received your details and will get back to you within one working day.\n\nWhat happens now?\n1. We check your details.\n2. If anything is unclear, we call or e-mail you within one working day.\n3. You receive your free, non-binding quote.\n\nYour answers:\n{{answers}}\n\nKind regards","de_DE":"Hallo {{field:name}},\n\nvielen Dank für deine Anfrage. Wir haben deine Angaben erhalten und melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags.\n\nWas passiert jetzt?\n1. Wir prüfen deine Angaben.\n2. Bei offenen Fragen melden wir uns innerhalb eines Werktags per Telefon oder E-Mail.\n3. Du erhältst dein kostenloses, unverbindliches Angebot.\n\nDeine Angaben:\n{{answers}}\n\nViele Grüße","de_DE_formal":"Hallo {{field:name}},\n\nvielen Dank für Ihre Anfrage. Wir haben Ihre Angaben erhalten und melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags.\n\nWas passiert jetzt?\n1. Wir prüfen Ihre Angaben.\n2. Bei offenen Fragen melden wir uns innerhalb eines Werktags per Telefon oder E-Mail.\n3. Sie erhalten Ihr kostenloses, unverbindliches Angebot.\n\nIhre Angaben:\n{{answers}}\n\nViele Grüße","es_ES":"Hola, {{field:name}}:\n\ngracias por tu solicitud. Hemos recibido tus datos y te responderemos en un día laborable.\n\n¿Qué pasa ahora?\n1. Revisamos tus datos.\n2. Si algo no está claro, te llamamos o escribimos en un día laborable.\n3. Recibes tu presupuesto gratuito y sin compromiso.\n\nTus respuestas:\n{{answers}}\n\nUn saludo","fr_FR":"Bonjour {{field:name}},\n\nmerci pour votre demande. Nous avons bien reçu vos informations et revenons vers vous sous un jour ouvré.\n\nEt maintenant ?\n1. Nous étudions vos informations.\n2. Si quelque chose n’est pas clair, nous vous appelons ou écrivons sous un jour ouvré.\n3. Vous recevez votre devis gratuit et sans engagement.\n\nVos réponses :\n{{answers}}\n\nBien cordialement","it_IT":"Ciao {{field:name}},\n\ngrazie per la tua richiesta. Abbiamo ricevuto i tuoi dati e ti risponderemo entro un giorno lavorativo.\n\nE adesso?\n1. Esaminiamo i tuoi dati.\n2. Se qualcosa non è chiaro, ti chiamiamo o scriviamo entro un giorno lavorativo.\n3. Ricevi il tuo preventivo gratuito e senza impegno.\n\nLe tue risposte:\n{{answers}}\n\nCordiali saluti"},"nl2br":true,"transport":{"type":"wp_mail"},"layout":"branded","recipientField":"c_email"}}],"style":{"preset":"default","theme":"neon","tokens":{"color.primary":"#22d3ee","color.onPrimary":"#0b0b0f","color.background":"#05060f","color.text":"#e8ecff","color.muted":"#9aa3c7","color.border":"#262b52",